            "review_title": "Review at XP Deli",
            "review_text": "Nam B\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nUnique, delicious dishes, clean restaurant, standard staff\nApr 2024 • Family\nThe restaurant is clean and decorated in a European restaurant style.\nThe staff is quick and friendly, the manager is very good.\nThe menu has many types of noodles, sauces, and toppings to choose from.\nDelicious chewy noodles, not salty sauce, just right, delicious, fresh seafood topping, well seasoned, very delicious, all ok. Next time I will try the bof rib topping, it looks so delicious.\nThe shop sells kumquat and perilla water, it has a unique taste, it's great to drink after eating mixed noodles.\nThe restaurant also has vegetarian noodles, for people on diets and vegetarians.\nIf you have the opportunity, you should try Premium mixed noodles, you will be satisfied.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 10, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
