            "review_title": "Review at XP Deli",
            "review_text": "8mup\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n1\nUnique, delicious, clean, very professional staff\nApr 2024 • Family\nThe restaurant is not like other regular noodle shops, decorated like a European restaurant, clean and airy, the staff serves quickly and enthusiastically, and has a manager who is quite friendly and attentive.\nThe menu is instant noodles, mixed with toppings, vegetables, poached eggs and sauces.\nAlthough it is instant noodles, they are not soft, chewy and not salty like other types of instant noodles.\nThe toppings are diverse, fresh and delicious, seasoned just right, I like the BBQ beef ribs and soy-soaked salmon.\nThere are 5 types of mixed sauces, you should try kumquat sauce and Laksa sauce, they go quite well with mixed noodles. Next time I will try the vegetarian sauce.\nOn the menu there are also bottled salted coffee, kumquat perilla juice, honey apricot juice, delicious and refreshing drinks.\n1 portion is quite a lot for a woman, men will be full.\nThe price is cheap compared to the quality received.\nThe restaurant also has vegetarian mixed noodles for vegetarians and dieters.\nI love the mixed noodles here and will come back many more times.\nI encourage you to come and try the food here, it's delicious and well worth it.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten May 8, 2024",
